The '''Bratric system''' was a [[star system]] mentioned by [[Jod Na Nawood]] when introducing the [[Wim]], [[Neel]], [[KB]], and [[Fern]] while they were disguised as the "Wise Elders" in order to gain entry to the [[Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa]].<ref name="Learn About Pirates" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Bratric system was was first mentioned in "[[You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates]]," the fifth episode of the [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 24]], [[2024]].<ref name="Learn About Pirates" /> In the episode, it is unspecified if Na Nawood completely makes up the Bratric system or if it is a real system in [[the galaxy]].

